{"text": " Dintre toate zonele din Bucure\u0219ti, una mi-a atras aten\u021bia \u00een mod special. Fabrica de glucoz\u0103. Aici s-au adunat cei mai tari dezvoltatori comisiune comun\u0103 s\u0103 creeze ora\u0219ul de 15 minute. Ce \u00eenseamn\u0103 asta? C\u0103 aici se construiesc \u0219coli, magazine, biserici, birouri \u0219i locuin\u021be de top \u0219i toate la 15 minute. De mers pe jos. Iar acum, f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 dau un nume, am s\u0103 v\u0103 ar\u0103t c\u00e2teva din cl\u0103dirile care se ridic\u0103 aici. Iar dac\u0103 ar trebui s\u0103 discut\u0103m despre interioare, ai mai bine s\u0103 v\u0103 ar\u0103t. Iar dac\u0103 te g\u00e2ndesc s\u0103 achi\u021bionezi un imobil aici, Nord Bucure\u0219ti este solu\u021bia.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 3.96, "text": " Dintre toate zonele din Bucure\u0219ti, una mi-a atras aten\u021bia \u00een mod special.", "tokens": [50364, 413, 686, 265, 281, 473, 6668, 306, 3791, 363, 1311, 540, 10355, 7317, 11, 2002, 2752, 12, 64, 412, 3906, 21723, 15918, 654, 15351, 1072, 2121, 13, 50562], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2503772408621652, "compression_ratio": 1.480968858131488, "no_speech_prob": 0.05775369331240654}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 5.64, "end": 6.84, "text": " Fabrica de glucoz\u0103.", "tokens": [50646, 17440, 15192, 368, 1563, 84, 1291, 89, 4089, 13, 50706], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2503772408621652, "compression_ratio": 1.480968858131488, "no_speech_prob": 0.05775369331240654}, {"id": 2, "seek": 0, "start": 6.92, "end": 10.44, "text": " Aici s-au adunat cei mai tari dezvoltatori comisiune comun\u0103", "tokens": [50710, 316, 8787, 262, 12, 1459, 614, 409, 267, 1769, 72, 12698, 3112, 72, 45057, 47610, 39842, 395, 8021, 2613, 11040, 4089, 50886], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2503772408621652, "compression_ratio": 1.480968858131488, "no_speech_prob": 0.05775369331240654}, {"id": 3, "seek": 0, "start": 10.52, "end": 13.040000000000001, "text": " s